				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				368,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Common): Replace puzzle piece emoji with factory worker in Architecture.md\n\nUpdate the emoji icon for the Common crate from the puzzle piece (🧩) to the factory worker (🧑🏻‍🏭) in both the table header badge and the main document heading of the Architecture documentation.\n\nThe puzzle piece emoji suggested a modular or jigsaw-like component, whereas the factory worker better communicates Common's role as the foundational workshop — a pure abstract library where every application capability, trait, DTO, and error type is forged before being concretely implemented by downstream components like Mountain and Air.",
			"SHA": "3f65c3a1a954a244aca4af914620d07d972e02fe"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-07-08T16:27:22Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				368,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Expand README with License, Changelog, and funding table\n\nAdd three new sections to the README: a License section with CC0 reference, a Changelog section pointing to the dedicated file, and an expanded Funding & Acknowledgements section that includes a table header row for Land, PlayForm, NLnet, and NGI0 Commons Fund, along with an introductory paragraph positioning Land as an open-source endeavor.\n\nThe funding description is updated to link to the NLnet project page and to format the EC program reference as a proper link. The CHANGELOG link is relocated from its previous standalone bullet into a dedicated section with an emoji heading for visual clarity. Table cell formatting is normalized (lowercased urls).\n\nThese changes provide visitors with clearer licensing information, a visible changelog reference, and proper attribution structure for project sponsors.",
			"SHA": "a45fc749cbf86908c3ba3eb4e00bee534562f64a"
		}
	],
